      "entries": [
        "Akila's mask melds into her face and she takes on the form of a leopard, or she returns to her halfling form. As a leopard, the only Strikes she can make are a jaws Strike (which deals 3d6+10 piercing damage plus Grab) and an agile claws Strike (which deals 3d4+10 slashing damage)."
      ]
    },
